  <item>
    <title>E14.印尼｜消费降级后，重新发现了巴厘岛的快乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661654cb48c40e2fb06d8257</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661654cb48c40e2fb06d8257</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Apr 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>8块的榴莲，50块的精油SPA，阳光海滩免费，在巴厘岛的淡季，体验到了消费降级的快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>巴厘岛可能是目前唯一让我觉得yq之后没有涨价，反而有些地方还更便宜的地方。</span></p><span></span><p><span>之前来巴厘岛都是泡酒店，这次在乌布小住一段时间，除了交通一如既往让人头晕，别的都开心。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>最好的攻略就是不要看攻略，自己去探索！</span></p><span></span><p><span>地球太美的瀑布⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4cGt-6W2A7ARoFt3u-ACzEZPca.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>分享一些照片～⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frs_R2tiBbhGzPqfMyvJHCpHD20U.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpddbc8WEr3K86k0V_ZjiyLeF7it.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlQsPvBVtd72SF-x3gEi2HP5PxRC.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv29G2WV1rtbQs_GUT7PMmqUgS4_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhi0L8_N6OpNgNWEmrcI3IGnW1C0.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhaGOeIjG-30bHrMzoAn-0sMj_w6.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvmDeq5udvTVSpnnsgJwgdFSgZjf.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6R1ukTO9lJOnneYyYoW-hg0fdv.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSMg1N7LDng6exfiRBGHrecPBk_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjj1Nk380uzb7p0h_qz4IzVlBfBl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>最后推荐的两个地方的地点⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk1JgXhJp9li11eaUnJSzU3pxzqI.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8YIj3k03RJQW46eSR583OC4kjl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>陈惜玉：摄影师、旅行博主，30岁之前没花多少钱，勉强走遍七大洲60+国家，全网同名：陈惜玉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>张红亮（玉米）：万物生长播客工作室主理人、自媒体人、《万物生长FM》《普通人的通告》等播客主播</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【万物生长播客工作室制作发行】</span></p>]]></description>
