    <title>E11.加拿大、新西兰、澳大利亚｜感受一下自然风光的震撼吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f70f42696bd9a879bd4ae5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f70f42696bd9a879bd4ae5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Mar 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年初春，Modern Woman* 来到北京办春季沙龙。Modern Woman* 的主理人大陶邀请我参加这个沙龙，会后我们聊到9年前一起去加拿大的旅行，她想到了很多细节，而我想起了改变了我人生观的震撼感受……畅聊之后，我邀请大陶在回上海前一起录一期播客。这一期，我们不仅聊了加拿大，还聊到了大陶在新西兰为期一年的打工旅行（working holiday），以及我们不太相同的澳洲之旅。接近两个小时的录音，依然意犹未尽，也算来了一次除了英美之外的英语系国家加新澳漫谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们大概聊了：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">1:20</a> 聊加拿大旅行的由头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">4:47</a>对于加拿大似乎没有太多印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a>在露易斯湖的冰面上走了2个小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a>埃德蒙顿的初印象是“萧条”令人讶异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a>阿尔伯塔公路旅行的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a>每一个看雪景的地方似乎都有小镇游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>加拿大旅行改变了我的人生态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">38:16</a>班夫的树林徒步之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a>对于新西兰的印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2758">45:58</a>打工旅行（working holiday）和旅行感受完全不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">54:30</a>在新西兰的多段换宿经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a>还是被皇后镇震撼到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3603">1:00:03</a>大陶在新西兰首次跳伞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3995">1:06:35</a>银蕨、毛利人、霍比特人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4263">1:11:03</a>大陶在新西兰习惯了对人微笑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4511">1:15:11</a>对澳大利亚的印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4574">1:16:14</a>对珀斯最大的印象就是人烟稀少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4762">1:19:22</a>大陶再次去澳洲打工旅行，经历了不一样的落差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5130">1:25:30</a>感受澳大利亚人真的敢于选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5655">1:34:15</a>悉尼邦代海滩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5882">1:38:02</a>期待可以在大自然里录一期播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的一些照片⬇️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqnUf5ObKZCSxFY-Kzv03goNP5l9.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljuEJblEBsYTYoQ1Zez9ux9Xy-S_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpAAMCj7K_1fddVLWW2jbfQnEVbz.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu4ce_4Qj9X1P09d3fZKSg98siKF.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7DLBn5LhBv5NMmtbPnyessO75L.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsZIaRl9Qd1_szTi8GkKqRnIv0lr.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大陶关于加拿大、新西兰、澳大利亚的一些文字⬇️</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UgczY4Di7Kr0W8L8ihyQ4A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UgczY4Di7Kr0W8L8ihyQ4A"><span>在班夫，经过冬天 | à</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/92KW9vuvGKN-7XMkbQu04Q" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/92KW9vuvGKN-7XMkbQu04Q"><span>蒂卡波岁月-新西兰日记</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sufX-PlTYtiY4f5NHfAFMA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sufX-PlTYtiY4f5NHfAFMA"><span>我在澳洲雪山住了100天</span></a></h1><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大陶：Modern Woman*主理人&amp;独立撰稿人&amp;《陶之声》主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>陈惜玉：摄影师、旅行博主，30岁之前没花多少钱，勉强走遍七大洲60+国家，全网同名：陈惜玉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>张红亮（玉米）：万物生长播客工作室主理人、自媒体人、《万物生长FM》《普通人的通告》等播客主播</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【万物生长播客工作室制作发行】</span></p>]]></description>
